```
# Rust-specific ignores
target/
Cargo.lock
**/*.rs.bk
**/*.tmp

# Dependencies
vendor/

# Logs and temp files
*.log
*.tmp
*.swp

# Environment
.env
.env.local
.env.*

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# OS generated files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Coverage reports
coverage/
htmlcov/
.coverage

# Build artifacts from other tools
dist/
build/
*.out
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.a
*.class

# Python-related (if mixed project)
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
.Python
env/
venv/
.venv/
pip-log.txt
pipenv.lock
```